flowchart TD
    INPUT([Raw Feature Observation x_i]) --> CLIP[Domain Bounds Clipping: clip x_i to lo, hi]
    CLIP --> DIR{Factor Direction?}
    DIR -- Higher is Better --> HB[Score = 100 * x - lo / hi - lo]
    DIR -- Lower is Better --> LB[Score = 100 * hi - x / hi - lo]
    HB --> NORM[Normalized Pillar Score S_k in 0..100]
    LB --> NORM
    NORM --> AGG[Dynamic Weight Allocation]
    WEIGHTS([User Weights or Persona Presets]) --> DYN_WEIGHT[Normalize Observed Weights: sum w_j = 1.0]
    DYN_WEIGHT --> AGG
    AGG --> GATE{Observed Factors >= Gate?}
    GATE -- 4 Factors Observed --> COMPLETE[Composite Score: Complete Data]
    GATE -- 3 Factors Observed --> PARTIAL[Composite Score: Partial Data Flagged]
    GATE -- < 3 Factors Observed --> UNSCORED[Entity Unscored & Excluded from Composite]
